          "canonical_hash": "sha256:71b62f75496382a5c755edabeb8a027a792f1ab143ac3a3d0b9a6d187c10188a",
          "description": "Extract readable text content from a specific webpage URL. Use this tool after web_search when you need the full text of a page found in search results. The tool strips scripts, styles, and navigation elements, returning only the meaningful text content. Output is truncated to 2000 characters to stay within context limits. Returns an empty string if the page cannot be fetched or parsed.",
